# Multiline DESCRIPTION, RELEASE_DATE, and changelog stamping
MAJOR_VERSION=3
STANDARD_VERSION=1
RELEASE_VERSION=0
DESCRIPTION<<END
Unlimited release prose: DESCRIPTION may use a heredoc (DESCRIPTION<<TAG … TAG).
Optional RELEASE_DATE=YYYY-MM-DD; if omitted, scripts/gen_version_changelog.c fills
the calendar date from time(3) at generation time. Version lock on merge runs
stamp_version_release_date.sh after finalize to append RELEASE_DATE to .ver files
that do not already have one (entries and locked stay aligned).
gen_version_changelog rejects malformed RELEASE_DATE values (strict YYYY-MM-DD).
The stamp script ignores lines inside DESCRIPTION heredocs when deciding whether to append.
END
